# Firebase
# NOTE: Native config files (google-services.json / GoogleService-Info.plist /
# firebase.json) are committed intentionally so the whole team shares the same
# private Firebase project. Access is protected by Firestore/Storage security
# rules, not by hiding these files. Do NOT make this repository public.
# Dart-source Firebase options are still ignored (keys must not live in source).
